@title(HyperDoc Core)

@in:package(hyperdoc/core)

HyperDoc is a hypertext documentation module for computational systems.

Its core contains the minimum of definitions that HyperDoc-containing systems must depend on in order to be able to create and register HyperDocs.

For more information about HyperDoc, see @hyperdoc[text="the HyperDoc of the main part"](HyperDoc).
